        <activityName xml:lang="en">Furnace, logs, hardwood, 50kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Furnace, logs, hardwood, 50kW
Inventory refers to the production of a logs furnace 50kW. Composition of the previous inventory was used and updated with the average weight of current logs furnaces available in Switzerland.\nTechnology: average technology\nTime period: Time of publications.\nVersion: 1\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Holzenergie\nLocal subcategory: Heizungssysteme\nUVEK 2022 source file:EcoSpold_furnace_logs_50kW_v0.3_gr_lwa.xml\n\n
UUID: 0ca4cd11-ca49-3569-9941-ca7f749664ae
Includes materials, transports and energy used for the fabrication of the furnace, the chimney and the automatic control technique.
Location: undefined
Technology: average technology
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0ca4cd11-ca49-3569-9941-ca7f749664ae.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
